  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beni-Hadadi Athira Nkhondo Samariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsono Beni-Hadadi mfumu ya ku Aramu inasonkhanitsa magulu ake onse a ankhondo. Iye pamodzi ndi mafumu 32, akavalo awo ndi magaleta awo, anapita kukawuzungulira mzinda wa Samariya ndi kuwuthira nkhondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anatuma amithenga ake mu mzindamo kwa Ahabu mfumu ya Israeli, kukanena kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Beni-Hadadi akuti, 'Siliva wako ndi golide wako ndi wanga, ndipo akazi ako okongola ndi ana ako ndi anganso.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfumu ya Israeli inayankha kuti, \"Monga mmene mwanenera, mbuye wanga mfumu, ine pamodzi ndi zonse zomwe ndili nazo ndi zanu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amithenga aja anabwereranso kwa Ahabu ndipo anamuwuza kuti, \"Beni-Hadadi akuti, 'Ine ndinakulamula kuti undipatse siliva wako ndi golide wako, akazi ako ndi ana ako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma mawa nthawi ngati yomwe ino ndidzatuma atumiki anga kudzafufuza mʼnyumba yako yaufumu ndi nyumba za akuluakulu ako. Iwo adzatenga chilichonse chimene umachidalira ndi kupita nacho.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamenepo mfumu ya Israeli inayitanitsa akuluakulu a mʼdzikomo niwawuza kuti, \"Taonani momwe munthuyu akufunira kutibweretsera mavuto! Atatumiza mawu oti ndimupatse akazi anga ndi ana anga, siliva wanga ndi golide wanga, ine sindinamukanize.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuluakulu onse ndi anthu onse anayankha kuti, \"Musamumvere kapena kuvomereza zofuna zake.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsono Ahabu anayankha amithenga a Beni-Hadadi kuti, \"Kamuwuzeni mbuye wanga mfumu kuti, 'Mtumiki wanu adzachita zonse zimene munazifuna nthawi yoyamba ija, koma izi mwazifunazi sindingazikwanitse.' \" Iwo anachoka nakapereka yankho kwa Beni-Hadadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamenepo Beni-Hadadi anatumizanso uthenga wina kwa Ahabu kuti, \"Milungu indilange koopsa, ngati mu Samariya mudzakhale fumbi loti nʼkudzaza dzanja la aliyense wa anthu anga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfumu ya Israeli inayankha kuti, \"Kamuwuzeni kuti, 'Mwamuna mnzako nʼpachulu, nʼkulinga utakwerapo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni-Hadadi anamva uthenga umenewu pamene iye ankamwa ndi mafumu anzake mʼmatenti awo, ndipo analamula anthu ake kuti, \"Konzekerani kukathira nkhondo.\" Choncho anakonzekera kukathira nkhondo mzindawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu Agonjetsa Beni-Hadadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo taonani, mneneri wina anabwera kwa Ahabu mfumu ya Israeli nadzalengeza kuti, \"Yehova akuti, 'Kodi ukuchiona chigulu chachikulu cha ankhondochi? Taona, ndikuchipereka chimenechi lero mʼdzanja lako, ndipo pamenepo udzadziwa kuti Ine ndine Yehova.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu anafunsa kuti, \"Koma ndani adzachita zimenezi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mneneri anayankha kuti, \"Yehova akuti, 'Adzachita zimenezi ndi asilikali a nduna za mʼzigawo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndipo iye anafunsa kuti, \"Kodi ndani adzayambe nkhondoyi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mneneriyo anayankha kuti, \"Ndinu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Choncho Ahabu anawerenga asilikali achinyamata a nduna za mʼzigawo ndipo onse analipo 232. Ndipo anawerenganso ankhondo a ku Israeli ndipo onse analipo 7,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwo ananyamuka nthawi yamasana pamene Beni-Hadadi ndi mafumu 32 othandizana naye ankamwa mpaka kuledzera mʼmatenti awo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali achinyamata a nduna za mʼzigawo ndiwo amene anayamba kupita ku nkhondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nthawi imeneyi Beni-Hadadi nʼkuti atatumiza anthu oti akazonde, amene anadzafotokoza kuti, \"Anthu ankhondo akubwera kuchokera ku Samariya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anati, \"Kaya akubwera mwamtendere kapena mwankhondo, muwagwire amoyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Choncho asilikali achinyamata a nduna za mʼzigawo anatuluka mu mzinda, gulu lankhondo lili pambuyo pawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo aliyense wa iwo anapha munthu wake. Ataona izi, Aaramu anathawa Aisraeli ali pambuyo pawo kuwapirikitsa. Koma Beni-Hadadi mfumu ya ku Aaramu anathawa atakwera pa kavalo pamodzi ndi ankhondo ena okweranso pa akavalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfumu ya Israeli inapita chitsogolo ndi kugwira akavalo ndi magaleta ndipo Aaramu ambiri anaphedwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zitachitika izi, mneneri wina anabwera kwa mfumu ya Israeli ndipo anati, \"Mulimbike ndipo muganize bwino zoti mudzachite, chifukwa chaka chikudzachi mfumu ya Aramu idzakuthiraninso nkhondo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi imeneyi, akuluakulu a mfumu ya Aramu anamulangiza kuti, \"Milungu ya anthu a ku Israeli ndi milungu ya mʼmapiri. Nʼchifukwa chake anali ndi mphamvu zotipambana ife. Koma ngati tidzamenyana nawo ku chigwa, ndithudi ife tidzakhala ndi mphamvu kuposa iwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inu chitani izi: chotsani mafumu onse pa maudindo awo ndipo mʼmalo mwawo muyikemo atsogoleri a ankhondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musonkhanitsenso gulu lankhondo lofanana ndi lomwe linaphedwa lija, akavalo monga omwe anaphedwa aja, ndi magaleta monga omwe anawonongedwa aja, kuti tikamenyane ndi Israeli ku chigwa. Pamenepo, ife tidzapambana iwowo.\" Beni-Hadadi anagwirizana nawo ndipo anachita momwemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaka chinacho Beni-Hadadi anasonkhanitsa Aaramu, napita ku Afeki kukamenyana ndi Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisraeli atasonkhananso, napatsidwa zakudya zawo anapita kukakumana nawo. Aisraeli anamanga misasa yawo moyangʼanana ndi Aaramu ndipo ankaoneka ngati timagulu tiwiri ta mbuzi, pomwe Aaramu anali atakuta dera lonselo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munthu wa Mulungu anabwera, nawuza mfumu ya Israeli kuti, \"Yehova akuti, 'Popeza Aaramu akuganiza kuti Yehova ndi mulungu wa ku mapiri, osati wa ku zigwa, Ine ndidzapereka chigulu chonsechi kwa iwe, ndipo iwe udzadziwa kuti Ine ndine Yehova.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa masiku asanu ndi awiri anakhala moyangʼanana mʼmisasa yawo, ndipo pa tsiku lachisanu ndi chiwiri nkhondo inayambika. Aisraeli anapha Aaramu okwana 100,000 tsiku limodzi lokha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena onse otsala anathawira ku Afeki, kumene khoma linagwera anthu 27,000. Ndipo Beni-Hadadi anathawira mu mzinda, nakabisala mʼchipinda chamʼkati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumiki ake anamuwuza kuti, \"Taonani, ife tamva kuti mafumu a fuko la Israeli ndi achifundo. Tiyeni tipite kwa mfumu ya ku Israeli titavala ziguduli mʼchiwuno mwathu ndi kumanga zingwe mʼmakosi mwathu. Mwina iye sakakuphani.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atavala ziguduli mʼchiwuno mwawo ndi kumanga zingwe mʼmakosi mwawo, anapita kwa mfumu ya ku Israeli ndipo anayiwuza kuti, \"Mtumiki wanu Beni-Hadadi akunena kuti, 'Chonde loleni kuti ndikhale moyo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mfumu inayankha kuti, \"Kodi iye akanali ndi moyo? Iye ujatu ndi mʼbale wanga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anthuwo ankaganiza kuti mawuwo anali abwino ndipo anavomereza mawuwa mofulumira. Iwo anati, \"Inde, Beni-Hadadi ndi mʼbale wanu!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mfumu inati, \"Pitani kamutengeni.\" Beni-Hadadi atatuluka, Ahabu anamukweza mʼgaleta lake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni-Hadadi anawuza Ahabu kuti, \"Ndidzabweza mizinda imene abambo anga analanda abambo anu. Ndipo mutha kumanga nyumba zanu zamalonda mu Damasiko, monga anachitira abambo anga ku Samariya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu anati, \"Chifukwa cha mgwirizano umenewu, ine ndidzakumasula.\" Choncho anachita naye mgwirizano, ndipo anamulola kuti apite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mneneri Adzudzula Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Molamulidwa ndi Yehova, mmodzi mwa ana a aneneri anawuza mnzake kuti, \"Chonde, menye ndi chida chako,\" koma mnzakeyo anakana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Choncho mneneriyo anati, \"Chifukwa sunamvere Yehova, ukangochoka pano, mkango ukupha.\" Ndipo munthuyo atangochoka pamenepo, mkango unamupeza ndi kumupha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mneneriyo anapeza munthu wina ndipo anamuwuza kuti, \"Chonde, menye.\" Choncho munthuyo anamumenya ndi kumuvulaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamenepo mneneriyo anapita nakayima pa msewu kudikirira mfumu. Iye anadzibisa nakulunga nsalu nkhope yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmene mfumu inkadutsa pamenepo, mneneriyo anafuwula kwa mfumuyo kuti, \"Ine mtumiki wanu ndinalowa pakati pa nkhondo, ndipo munthu wina anabwera kwa ine atatenga mmodzi mwa anthu ogwidwa pa nkhondo, nandiwuza kuti, 'Sunga munthu uyu. Ngati asowa, ndiye kuti ndidzakupha, kapena udzalipira ndalama 3,000 za siliva.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamene ine mtumiki wanu ndinali wotanganidwa apa ndi apa, munthuyo anasowa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 20:40"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mfumu ya Israeli inati, \"Chimenechi ndiye chilango chako. Iwe wadziweruza wekha.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamenepo mneneriyo anachotsa msangamsanga nsalu yomwe anakulunga pa nkhope yake, ndipo mfumu ya Israeli inamuzindikira kuti ndi mmodzi mwa aneneri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anawuza mfumu kuti, \"Yehova akuti, 'Chifukwa chakuti mwamasula munthu amene Ine ndinati ndi woyenera kuphedwa, inuyo ndi amene mudzaphedwe mʼmalo mwa iyeyo, anthu anu mʼmalo mwa anthu ake.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwachisoni ndi mokwiya, mfumu ya Israeli inapita ku nyumba yake yaufumu ku Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
